            The best protein powder for a sensitive stomach is usually the plainest one you can tolerate drinking. For most people that means a whey isolate or hydrolysate with no sugar alcohols, inulin or gums, such as Dymatize ISO100. For a low-FODMAP diet, a certified option such as Casa de Sante whey isolate or drink wholesome egg white removes the guesswork, and for dairy-free stomachs, egg white or single-ingredient pea is the gentlest place to start.
          </p>
